| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | Runs config/project.json `ci_pipeline.steps` in order, `make check-all`, lint, types, `make site-data` and the tests among them, on every push and pull request, on the Python and Node `config/project.json` `toolchain` names. | push or open a pull request | [`ci_pipeline.steps`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`toolchain.python`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`toolchain.node_major`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | One runner image and one Python version. Not the GitLab adapter: `.gitlab-ci.yml` runs the same steps there. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | when ci_pipeline != gitlab |
